From: EmderYi <1042164240@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 11:21:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] perf(causal-attention): fold blocks into batch and share
 KV between image and action queries

State blocks attend only to themselves, so fold the block dimension
into the batch dimension and process all blocks with a single batched
attention call instead of a loop.

Noisy image and action blocks for the same block index share the same
K/V context; process them in one attention call and split the output by
the image query length. This halves the number of attention calls
previously issued separately for image and action queries.

Drop the roped_query/roped_key list accumulation and single cat, slicing
the roped context/noisy tensors directly.
